Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:06:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove AAA Certificate Services under the eMudhra policy

Remove the Comodo AAA Certificate Services root and its associated metadata to enforce Azure Linux's eMudhra certificate exclusion policy. This is the AAA root, not an eMudhra-issued certificate.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 lib/httpclient/cacert.pem     | 24 ------------------------
 lib/httpclient/cacert1024.pem | 24 ------------------------
 2 files changed, 48 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/httpclient/cacert.pem b/lib/httpclient/cacert.pem
index 742dc6e..d219073 100644
--- a/lib/httpclient/cacert.pem
+++ b/lib/httpclient/cacert.pem
@@ -460,30 +460,6 @@ GrZgFCdsMneMvLJymM/NzD+5yCRCFNZX/OYmQ6kd5YCQzgNUKD73P9P4Te1qCjqTE5s7FCMTY5w/
